{"id":"ca86ab47-6386-47f4-8a24-809af17a784d","object":"chat.completion","created":1784995168,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    lines = case.get('lines', [])\\n    trajectory = []\\n    allowed = {'thought'}\\n    for idx, line in enumerate(lines, 1):\\n        if line.startswith('Thought:'):\\n            typ = 'thought'\\n            content = line[8:].strip()\\n        elif line.startswith('Action:'):\\n            typ = 'action'\\n            content = line[7:].strip()\\n        elif line.startswith('Observation:'):\\n            typ = 'observation'\\n            content = line[12:].strip()\\n        elif line.startswith('Final:'):\\n            typ = 'final'\\n            content = line[6:].strip()\\n        else:\\n            return {'valid': False, 'error_line': idx, 'trajectory': trajectory}\\n        if typ not in allowed:\\n            return {'valid': False, 'error_line': idx, 'trajectory': trajectory}\\n        trajectory.append({'type': typ, 'content': content})\\n        if typ == 'thought':\\n            allowed = {'action', 'final'}\\n        elif typ == 'action':\\n            allowed = {'observation'}\\n        elif typ == 'observation':\\n            allowed = {'thought'}\\n        else:\\n            allowed = set()\\n    if allowed == set():\\n        return {'valid': True, 'error_line': None, 'trajectory': trajectory}\\n    else:\\n        return {'valid': False, 'error_line': len(lines) + 1, 'trajectory': trajectory}\"}","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) for task AGENT-RA-01. The case contains a payload with \"lines\" array and \"_case_nonce\". We need to parse lines as ReAct trajectory: Thought, Action, Action Input? Actually the description says \"Parse and validate interleaved Thought, Action, Action Input, and Observation records under a registered tool schema and stop grammar.\" But looking at the fixtures, the lines 